      <NodeDefinition Name="TransferNode" Id="0d40fbf0-8206-443f-b771-65f85633a2f6" Revision="168" FileVersion="256" Author="Simio Employee" Description="A TransferNode object may be used by an entity to transfer into or out of an object. This type of node may also be used to define an intersection point in a network of links. Optional entity destination selection and transport logic is provided." CreationDateTime="2025-04-02T21:04:12.4446551Z" Color="1e90ff">
